		Heading 1:
			Text: Alt and Link
		Paragraph: An image with `Alt` is a figure of the tagged PDF and a screen reader reads that text. Without `Alt` it is decoration and is skipped, which suits ornaments and backgrounds. `Link` makes the whole image lead to an address or to a box of the document.
